OL,3,AChance of storms this week as Atlantic
OL,4,Ajet stream roars into life
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe UK may see its first named storm of
OL,7,Fthe autumn as forecasts show the
OL,8,Fpotential for a deep area of low
OL,9,Fpressure to cross the UK later this
OL,10,Fweek.
OL,12,FA strengthening jet stream triggered by
OL,13,Ftemperature contrasts across North
OL,14,FAmerica will cause turbulent conditions
OL,15,Fto develop.
OL,17,FAll areas will experience rain at
OL,18,Ftimes, including those currently in
OL,19,Fdrought, but amounts of rain will
OL,20,Fdepend on the exact track of a stormy
OL,21,Flow pressure system later in the week.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
